{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/7b7ac571f07bcf0e7aaf9d4e26cf5ba2.webp?t=1772963570\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrived at the villa expecting a vacation. Instead, you found a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/e0da971290c7c33a1a51eec1d9ee0c8d.poster.avif?t=1772963570\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/e0da971290c7c33a1a51eec1d9ee0c8d.webm?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/e0da971290c7c33a1a51eec1d9ee0c8d.mp4?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the villa. <strong>A terrifying, unpredictable creature stalks the corridors,</strong> and its only goal is to find you. Listen for its footsteps, watch the shadows, and use the environment to hide. Every creak of the floorboards could be your last. You can't kill it, you can only hope to outsmart it. Use tools like flares to create a distraction or fireworks to stun it in a last-ditch effort to survive an attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/2917bb5c3f9e932aa01b225fe9154d39.webp?t=1772963570\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/476ca3f208397f4fc192684ef2865c42.poster.avif?t=1772963570\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/476ca3f208397f4fc192684ef2865c42.webm?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/476ca3f208397f4fc192684ef2865c42.mp4?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the nightmare alone or team up with up to three other players. Communication is critical: will you stick together and increase your chances of being found, or split up to cover more ground? Your friend's scream down the hall could be a deadly distraction or the last sound they ever make. The choice is yours, but remember: no one escapes alone easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/2bb91950ae79633c190a7b9fb179704b.webp?t=1772963570\" width=800 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/bab42a30f506687aea6644bb17d36211.poster.avif?t=1772963570\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/bab42a30f506687aea6644bb17d36211.webm?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/bab42a30f506687aea6644bb17d36211.mp4?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two games of Midnight Escape are ever the same.</strong> The villa is designed for maximum replayability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Item Spawns:</strong> Key items, survival tools, and clues are randomized every match. You'll never know where to look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable AI:</strong> The creature has no set patrol paths. It learns, adapts, and will always keep you guessing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> There are four key &quot;Story Items&quot; hidden in the villa, but only two will spawn in each game. Every combination of two items leads to one of <strong>six unique endings</strong>. Will you escape by car, call for help, or find a more... creative way out? Every playthrough is a new puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/1578ca990e776ff0f9b6c4496bdf97cd.poster.avif?t=1772963570\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/1578ca990e776ff0f9b6c4496bdf97cd.webm?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/1578ca990e776ff0f9b6c4496bdf97cd.mp4?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739620?t=1772963570","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/d85852d39336da10a733a2dcb6e20f8c6a33c856/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772963570","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/5c431d722e61e3d9c8512add8addaf027a995412/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772963570","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/5c431d722e61e3d9c8512add8addaf027a995412/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772963570","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/7b7ac571f07bcf0e7aaf9d4e26cf5ba2.webp?t=1772963570\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrived at the villa expecting a vacation. Instead, you found a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/e0da971290c7c33a1a51eec1d9ee0c8d.poster.avif?t=1772963570\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/e0da971290c7c33a1a51eec1d9ee0c8d.webm?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/e0da971290c7c33a1a51eec1d9ee0c8d.mp4?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in the villa. <strong>A terrifying, unpredictable creature stalks the corridors,</strong> and its only goal is to find you. Listen for its footsteps, watch the shadows, and use the environment to hide. Every creak of the floorboards could be your last. You can't kill it, you can only hope to outsmart it. Use tools like flares to create a distraction or fireworks to stun it in a last-ditch effort to survive an attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/2917bb5c3f9e932aa01b225fe9154d39.webp?t=1772963570\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/476ca3f208397f4fc192684ef2865c42.poster.avif?t=1772963570\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/476ca3f208397f4fc192684ef2865c42.webm?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/476ca3f208397f4fc192684ef2865c42.mp4?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the nightmare alone or team up with up to three other players. Communication is critical: will you stick together and increase your chances of being found, or split up to cover more ground? Your friend's scream down the hall could be a deadly distraction or the last sound they ever make. The choice is yours, but remember: no one escapes alone easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/2bb91950ae79633c190a7b9fb179704b.webp?t=1772963570\" width=800 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/bab42a30f506687aea6644bb17d36211.poster.avif?t=1772963570\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/bab42a30f506687aea6644bb17d36211.webm?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/bab42a30f506687aea6644bb17d36211.mp4?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two games of Midnight Escape are ever the same.</strong> The villa is designed for maximum replayability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Item Spawns:</strong> Key items, survival tools, and clues are randomized every match. You'll never know where to look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable AI:</strong> The creature has no set patrol paths. It learns, adapts, and will always keep you guessing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> There are four key &quot;Story Items&quot; hidden in the villa, but only two will spawn in each game. Every combination of two items leads to one of <strong>six unique endings</strong>. Will you escape by car, call for help, or find a more... creative way out? Every playthrough is a new puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/1578ca990e776ff0f9b6c4496bdf97cd.poster.avif?t=1772963570\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739620/extras/1578ca990e776ff0f9b6c4496bdf97cd.webm?t=1772963570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as